        ],
        "comparison": "absolute difference; explicitly named species/contact; Figure 6 source target The primary contact oxygen is input atom-map ID 49 in each of PO and PA; P is ID 46. PA O49 is the oxygen drawn as C48=O49 in the supplied mapped graph, not O50 or acyl O51. Track the designated input atoms under documented equivalent renumbering; do not exchange oxygens based on distances or target agreement. Use the same O49 for O_P_A and both H contacts on each optimized geometry; select the nearest H separately within all N-ethyl alphaH and betaH graph-defined sets. Break exact H-distance ties by the smallest input atom-map ID and disclose the tie. No averaging or minimization across different oxygens. Verify summaries against species[].distances and method.mapping_notes; keep other O/H contacts as auxiliary evidence."
      }
    },
